    "description": "<p>Acquired with CR 11 or higher. &laquo;Plasma Field&raquo; ignores [Cancel: Shock] status on targets and the strength of the [Barrier] is increased by +[Recovery].</p>\n<p>(SR2): Gain +1D to your [Accuracy check] for &laquo;Lightning Chamber&raquo;.</p>\n<hr>\n<p>You are a sorcerer who specializes in magic that manipulates electric shocks. Its power, compared to the wrath of God, will be your ally in offense and defense.</p>",
